{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015f8mL8i2744jfeLmHpMp5a","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心 \"type-valid IE\" framing 不成立，需完全 reframe。仍冲 EMNLP 2026（October\n2\t  ARR cycle），不降级 venue。 Reframe: \"constrained decoding method paper\" → \"empirical\n3\t  study paper with a tool\"。 新 title: \"How Do LLMs Violate Ontology Constraints? A\n4\t  Systematic Study with Mitigation\"。 新 story: (1) violation landscape 系统性实证研究为主贡献；(2)\n5\t  OntoCoDec 降级为 mitigation tool； (3) 重心转向 analysis findings — why prompt 不够、why post-hoc\n6\t  不够、why grammar-only 不够、why CF 必然存在。 Novelty 锚点从 method → empirical findings + theoretical\n7\t  analysis，回避 \"incremental over XGrammar\"。 补充: (a) per-relation-type violation pattern\n8\t  深度分析；(b) GoLLIE code-generation IE violation 对比； (c) decidability taxonomy 扩展为 formal\n9\t  framework。 预估 reviewer 评分: Overall 2.5–3.5, Novelty 2–3, Soundness 3–3.5, Significance\n10\t  2–3, hostile_reviewer_count 2–3。\n11\t\n12\t  '\n13\timagined_experiments:\n14\t- name: WikiEvents Qwen3-8B unconstrained\n15\t  plan_id: P021\n16\t  description: WikiEvents EE unconstrained baseline, Qwen3-8B, 246 docs\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    parse_rate_pct: 88.6\n19\t    EV_pct: 24.0\n20\t    RoV_pct: 74.9\n21\t    AC_pct: 0.3\n22\t    CF_pct: 0\n23\t    trigger_f1_pct: 11.84\n24\t    argument_f1_pct: 0.09\n25\t    entity_f1_pct: 0\n26\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。Entity-F1=0%、Arg-F1≈0% 是 ZS EE 固有困难——模型无法输出 schema-valid\n27\t    entity 格式。Worst 档 reviewer 抓住 baseline 几乎不工作这一点：\"Even the baseline shows EE is\n28\t    barely functional; any ''improvement'' on near-zero is format compliance recovery,\n29\t    not semantic extraction.\" RoV=74.9% 虽然展示了 constraint 需求，但 reviewer 反转叙事： \"This\n30\t    proves ZS EE is fundamentally broken, not that your method fixes it.\"\n31\t\n32\t    '\n33\t  tables:\n34\t  - name: WikiEvents ZS Unconstrained Baselines (3 Models)\n35\t    columns:\n36\t    - Model\n37\t    - Parse%\n38\t    - EV%\n39\t    - RoV%\n40\t    - AC%\n41\t    - Trig-F1\n42\t    - Arg-F1\n43\t    - Ent-F1\n44\t    rows:\n45\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n46\t      - '88.6'\n47\t      - '24.0'\n48\t      - '74.9'\n49\t      - '0.3'\n50\t      - '11.8'\n51\t      - '0.09'\n52\t      - '0'\n53\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n54\t      - '91.9'\n55\t      - '10.5'\n56\t      - '88.8'\n57\t      - '0.1'\n58\t      - '5.7'\n59\t      - '0'\n60\t      - '0'\n61\t    - - Mistral-7B\n62\t      - '78.9'\n63\t      - '37.3'\n64\t      - '63.9'\n65\t      - '0'\n66\t      - '2.4'\n67\t      - '0'\n68\t      - '0'\n69\t  figures_description:\n70\t  - Per-model violation type stacked bar chart (EV/RoV/AC)\n71\t  analysis: '三模型 Entity-F1=0% / Arg-F1≈0% 成为 \"EE completely dismissed\" 的核心证据。 Reviewer:\n72\t    \"Arg F1≈0, Entity F1 from 0→14% is just format compliance, not extraction improvement.\"\n73\t    不视为 constraint enforcement 机会，而视为 task 选择失败。\n74\t\n75\t    '\n76\t- name: WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B unconstrained\n77\t  plan_id: P023\n78\t  description: WikiEvents EE unconstrained baseline, Llama-3.1-8B, 246 docs\n79\t  expected_results:\n80\t    parse_rate_pct: 91.9\n81\t    EV_pct: 10.5\n82\t    RoV_pct: 88.8\n83\t    AC_pct: 0.1\n84\t    CF_pct: 0\n85\t    trigger_f1_pct: 5.72\n86\t    argument_f1_pct: 0\n87\t    entity_f1_pct: 0\n88\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。Llama RoV=88.8% 是三模型最高——近 9/10 argument role 不在 event\n89\t    type 定义中。Trigger-F1=5.7% 低于 Qwen。Worst 档 reviewer: \"This model is completely non-functional\n90\t    for EE. Constrained decoding on non-functional extraction is a constraint compliance\n91\t    demo, not an IE contribution.\"\n92\t\n93\t    '\n94\t  tables: []\n95\t  figures_description: []\n96\t  analysis: 'Llama RoV=88.8% 超过 Qwen 74.9%，模型间 violation pattern 差异巨大，但 worst-tier\n97\t    reviewer 不关心差异，只关心 Arg-F1=0%。\n98\t\n99\t    '\n100\t- name: WikiEvents Mistral-7B unconstrained\n101\t  plan_id: P025\n102\t  description: WikiEvents EE unconstrained baseline, Mistral-7B-v0.3, 246 docs\n103\t  expected_results:\n104\t    parse_rate_pct: 78.9\n105\t    EV_pct: 37.3\n106\t    RoV_pct: 63.9\n107\t    AC_pct: 0\n108\t    CF_pct: 0\n109\t    trigger_f1_pct: 2.41\n110\t    argument_f1_pct: 0\n111\t    entity_f1_pct: 0\n112\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。Parse rate 最低 (78.9%)，EV 最高 (37.3%)——超 1/3 event type\n113\t    是 OOV。 Trigger-F1=2.4% 几乎为零。Worst 档 reviewer: \"If your chosen model can''t even\n114\t    produce valid event type names 37% of the time, the task setup itself is problematic.\"\n115\t    选择明显 不适合此 task 的模型被质疑为 cherry-pick 不利 baseline 以夸大改善。\n116\t\n117\t    '\n118\t  tables: []\n119\t  figures_description: []\n120\t  analysis: 'Mistral 是 EE 最差模型。Worst-tier reviewer 质疑为何选择它——如果用来展示\"更差模型更需要 constraint\"，那\n121\t    Arg-F1=0% 的 baseline 使任何 improvement 都无意义。\n122\t\n123\t    '\n124\t- name: WikiEvents Mistral grammar-only v3\n125\t  plan_id: P027\n126\t  description: Grammar-only ablation on Mistral WikiEvents, proves semantic layer\n127\t    necessity for EE\n128\t  expected_results:\n129\t    parse_rate_pct: 88.6\n130\t    EV_pct: 0\n131\t    RoV_pct: 64.0\n132\t    AC_pct: 13.8\n133\t    CF_pct: 1.1\n134\t    entity_f1_pct: 11.92\n135\t    trigger_f1_pct: 3.37\n136\t    argument_f1_pct: 0.27\n137\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。Grammar-only 消除 EV→0% 但 RoV 仍 64%——grammar CFG 无法约束 80\n138\t    个 event-type-conditioned argument roles。AC 上升至 13.8%（latent violation surfacing，\n139\t    与 DocRED RE 模式一致）。本应是 two-layer necessity 有力证据。但 worst 档 reviewer: \"Of course\n140\t    grammar can''t do semantic constraints — this is not an insight, it''s an expected\n141\t    outcome. Your ablation confirms the obvious.\" 被视为 trivially expected， 不构成 contribution。更关键:\n142\t    CF 从 1.1%(grammar-only) 升到 14.9%(full_s1)—— semantic 层引入大量 CF。\n143\t\n144\t    '\n145\t  tables:\n146\t  - name: WikiEvents Grammar-Only vs Full S1 (Mistral)\n147\t    columns:\n148\t    - Config\n149\t    - EV%\n150\t    - RoV%\n151\t    - AC%\n152\t    - CF%\n153\t    - Ent-F1\n154\t    rows:\n155\t    - - unconstrained\n156\t      - '37.3'\n157\t      - '63.9'\n158\t      - '0'\n159\t      - '0'\n160\t      - '0'\n161\t    - - grammar_only\n162\t      - '0'\n163\t      - '64.0'\n164\t      - '13.8'\n165\t      - '1.1'\n166\t      - '11.9'\n167\t    - - full_s1\n168\t      - '0'\n169\t      - '0'\n170\t      - '1.3'\n171\t      - '14.9'\n172\t      - '11.7'\n173\t  figures_description:\n174\t  - 'Three-bar violation distribution comparison: unconstrained / grammar_only / full_s1'\n175\t  analysis: 'Ablation 结论正确但被视为 trivial。更致命的是数据暴露了 CF trade-off: grammar_only CF=1.1%\n176\t    → full_s1 CF=14.9%。Reviewer: \"Adding your semantic layer increases cross-field\n177\t    violations by 14× while providing no extraction quality improvement. The cure\n178\t    is worse than the disease.\"\n179\t\n180\t    '\n181\t- name: WikiEvents EE post-hoc filtering (3 models)\n182\t  plan_id: P028\n183\t  description: Post-hoc filtering baseline for EE, quantifies argument deletion rate\n184\t  expected_results:\n185\t    qwen_args_before: 5467\n186\t    qwen_args_after: 23\n187\t    qwen_discard_pct: 99.6\n188\t    llama_args_before: 5053\n189\t    llama_args_after: 3\n190\t    llama_discard_pct: 99.9\n191\t    mistral_args_before: 6034\n192\t    mistral_args_after: 0\n193\t    mistral_discard_pct: 100.0\n194\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据（从 v3 constrained 结果的 posthoc 字段计算）。Post-hoc 需删除 99.6-100%\n195\t    arguments 才能达 0% violation——RE 中仅 16-48%。本应是 paper 强力卖点（\"post-hoc non-viable for\n196\t    EE, constrained decoding is the only option\"）。但 worst 档 reviewer 翻转叙事: \"This confirms\n197\t    ZS EE is fundamentally broken, not that your method solves it. When 99.6% of generated\n198\t    arguments are violations, the model has no understanding of the task — your grammar\n199\t    is just producing well-formatted noise.\"\n200\t\n201\t    '\n202\t  tables:\n203\t  - name: 'Post-hoc Filtering: RE vs EE Discard Rate'\n204\t    columns:\n205\t    - Task\n206\t    - Model\n207\t    - Discard%\n208\t    - Remaining\n209\t    rows:\n210\t    - - RE SciERC\n211\t      - Qwen\n212\t      - 16.8%\n213\t      - 1435 triples\n214\t    - - RE DocRED\n215\t      - Qwen\n216\t      - 48.1%\n217\t      - 9076 triples\n218\t    - - EE WikiEvents\n219\t      - Qwen\n220\t      - 99.6%\n221\t      - 23 args\n222\t    - - EE WikiEvents\n223\t      - Llama\n224\t      - 99.9%\n225\t      - 3 args\n226\t    - - EE WikiEvents\n227\t      - Mistral\n228\t      - 100%\n229\t      - 0 args\n230\t  figures_description:\n231\t  - Bar chart comparing post-hoc discard rates across RE and EE tasks\n232\t  analysis: 'Post-hoc 毁灭性结果在 worst 档被用来否定整个 EE evaluation 的价值。Reviewer 不接受 \"constrained\n233\t    decoding is the only option\" 论点，而认为 \"no option works for ZS EE, so why evaluate\n234\t    it.\"\n235\t\n236\t    '\n237\t- name: 70B SciERC unconstrained + constrained (ZS)\n238\t  plan_id: P029\n239\t  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 on SciERC ZS, scale generalization 8B→70B\n240\t  expected_results:\n241\t    unconstrained_DR_pct: 6.5\n242\t    unconstrained_RV_pct: 0.6\n243\t    unconstrained_R_F1: 11.22\n244\t    unconstrained_E_F1: 35.17\n245\t    constrained_DR_pct: 0\n246\t    constrained_CF_pct: 3.66\n247\t    constrained_R_F1: 11.24\n248\t    constrained_E_F1: 35.14\n249\t    parse_failures: 0\n250\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。DR=0% 是完美消除，CF=3.66% 低于 8B 的 9.9%。但 worst 档关注两点: (1) R-F1=11.24%\n251\t    仍是 \"toy evaluation\" — \"A 70B model achieving 11% relation F1 in ZS is not a serious\n252\t    evaluation setting.\" (2) 70B unconstrained DR=6.5% 远低于 8B 的 15.4% — \"Larger models\n253\t    are already more constraint-compliant; the marginal value of your method diminishes\n254\t    with scale.\" 即 DR=0% 被视为 expected（大模型本来就更合规），不是 method contribution。\n255\t\n256\t    '\n257\t  tables:\n258\t  - name: 'Scale Comparison: 8B vs 70B ZS SciERC'\n259\t    columns:\n260\t    - Model\n261\t    - DR-unc%\n262\t    - DR-con%\n263\t    - CF-con%\n264\t    - R-F1\n265\t    rows:\n266\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n267\t      - '15.37'\n268\t      - '0.93'\n269\t      - '9.90'\n270\t      - '8.36'\n271\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n272\t      - '13.34'\n273\t      - '0.08'\n274\t      - '6.56'\n275\t      - '2.54'\n276\t    - - Qwen3-70B\n277\t      - '6.50'\n278\t      - '0.00'\n279\t      - '3.66'\n280\t      - '11.24'\n281\t  figures_description:\n282\t  - Model scale vs baseline violation rate, showing diminishing marginal constraint\n283\t    value\n284\t  analysis: '70B 创造两难: (a) DR=0% 证明方法完美工作; (b) 大模型 baseline violation 更低，削弱 \"需要 constrained\n285\t    decoding\" 论点。Reviewer: \"As models scale, they naturally become more compliant.\n286\t    Your method solves a problem that is disappearing.\"\n287\t\n288\t    '\n289\t- name: 70B DocRED unconstrained + constrained (ZS)\n290\t  plan_id: P030\n291\t  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 on DocRED ZS, scale generalization\n292\t  expected_results:\n293\t    unconstrained_DR_pct: 15.0\n294\t    unconstrained_RV_pct: 7.8\n295\t    unconstrained_ET_pct: 0.02\n296\t    unconstrained_R_F1: 13.03\n297\t    unconstrained_E_F1: 69.03\n298\t    constrained_DR_pct: 0\n299\t    constrained_CF_pct: 7.01\n300\t    constrained_R_F1: 13.07\n301\t    constrained_E_F1: 69.05\n302\t    parse_failures: 1\n303\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。DR=0% 是 DocRED 上的最佳结果（优于 Qwen-8B 10.21%、Llama-8B 2.55%）。\n304\t    但 CF=7.01%。Worst 档: \"On DocRED (96 relations), CF=7.01% means roughly 1 in 14\n305\t    entities has inconsistent typing. Combined with 8B CF=10-12%, this is systematic,\n306\t    not a corner case.\" 70B unc DR=15% 与 8B Qwen DR=18.46% 差距不大—— \"70B doesn''t help\n307\t    much on DocRED, yet your method introduces 7% CF.\" CF 没有随模型规模减少（70B CF=7.01% >\n308\t    Qwen-8B CF=2.57%），支持 \"CF is inherent to the method\" 攻击线。\n309\t\n310\t    '\n311\t  tables:\n312\t  - name: DocRED Cross-Scale CF Comparison\n313\t    columns:\n314\t    - Model\n315\t    - DR-unc%\n316\t    - DR-con%\n317\t    - CF-con%\n318\t    - R-F1-delta\n319\t    rows:\n320\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n321\t      - '18.46'\n322\t      - '10.21'\n323\t      - '2.57'\n324\t      - '+0.50'\n325\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n326\t      - '26.07'\n327\t      - '2.55'\n328\t      - '12.02'\n329\t      - '+0.29'\n330\t    - - Qwen3-70B\n331\t      - '15.00'\n332\t      - '0.00'\n333\t      - '7.01'\n334\t      - '+0.04'\n335\t  figures_description: []\n336\t  analysis: 'DocRED 70B CF=7.01% 介于 Qwen-8B (2.57%) 和 Llama-8B (12.02%) 之间，没有 scale\n337\t    改善趋势。Reviewer 判定 CF 是方法固有缺陷，非模型 artifact。\n338\t\n339\t    '\n340\t- name: Error analysis / case study\n341\t  plan_id: P031\n342\t  description: '10-20 representative cases: AC residual 根因、CF root cause、qualitative\n343\t    evidence'\n344\t  expected_results:\n345\t    ac_residual_cases_examined: 15\n346\t    cf_root_cause_type_ambiguity_pct: 45\n347\t    cf_root_cause_model_confusion_pct: 40\n348\t    cf_root_cause_ontology_gap_pct: 15\n349\t    actionable_insight_count: 2\n350\t  result_rationale: '预测数据（定性分析）。AC 残余案例显示模型在语义相近 entity types（SID vs SEN, PER vs SID）\n351\t    上持续混淆——constrained decoding 无法解决语义理解问题。CF 根因: ~45% 来自 ontology type system 语义边界模糊（Generic↔OtherScientificTerm），40%\n352\t    来自模型在不同 relation context 下对同一 entity 的 type assignment 不一致，15% 来自 ontology 设计缺陷。\n353\t    Worst 档 reviewer 引用 case study: \"Nearly half of CF is a dataset artifact and 40%\n354\t    is a model capability problem — neither is addressable by constrained decoding.\n355\t    The error analysis reveals that the method''s limitations are more interesting\n356\t    than its contributions.\"\n357\t\n358\t    '\n359\t  tables: []\n360\t  figures_description:\n361\t  - Entity type confusion matrix for CF violations\n362\t  - Case study examples with annotated violation chains\n363\t  analysis: 'Error analysis 在 worst 档反而成为攻击弹药。每个 case 指向 constrained decoding 根本 局限:\n364\t    只能 enforce 局部约束，无法解决跨 relation 一致性和模型语义理解。Reviewer 直接 引用 case study 论证 limitations\n365\t    > contributions。\n366\t\n367\t    '\n368\t- name: EE FT composability\n369\t  plan_id: P032\n370\t  description: Fine-tuned model + OntoCoDec composability on WikiEvents EE\n371\t  expected_results:\n372\t    qwen_ft_unc_trigger_f1: 32.08\n373\t    qwen_ft_unc_arg_f1: 7.85\n374\t    qwen_ft_unc_rov_pct: 38.3\n375\t    qwen_ft_con_trigger_f1: 26.72\n376\t    qwen_ft_con_arg_f1: 8.18\n377\t    qwen_ft_con_rov_pct: 0\n378\t    qwen_ft_con_ac_pct: 0\n379\t    llama_ft_unc_trigger_f1: 27.52\n380\t    llama_ft_unc_arg_f1: 9.98\n381\t    llama_ft_unc_rov_pct: 8.8\n382\t    llama_ft_con_trigger_f1: 26.91\n383\t    llama_ft_con_arg_f1: 8.91\n384\t    llama_ft_con_rov_pct: 0\n385\t    llama_ft_con_ac_pct: 0.8\n386\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据（p1_ee_ft_composability_r5 + p1_ee_ft_llama_r2）。关键问题: (1)\n387\t    Qwen Trigger-F1 从 32.08%→26.72%（-5.36pp），constrained decoding 明显损害 trigger extraction\n388\t    质量。Reviewer: \"Your method trades extraction quality for constraint compliance\n389\t    — Structure Snowballing (Tam et al. 2024) already documented this trade-off.\"\n390\t    (2) Arg-F1 改善微乎其微（Qwen +0.33pp, Llama -1.07pp 实际下降）。 (3) Llama constrained AC=0.8%\n391\t    表明 FT regime 下仍无法完全消除 argument constraint violations。 Reviewer 总结: \"The only outcome\n392\t    is constraint compliance at the cost of extraction performance. This is a net\n393\t    negative contribution.\"\n394\t\n395\t    '\n396\t  tables:\n397\t  - name: EE FT Composability Impact\n398\t    columns:\n399\t    - Model\n400\t    - Config\n401\t    - Trig-F1\n402\t    - Arg-F1\n403\t    - RoV%\n404\t    - AC%\n405\t    rows:\n406\t    - - Qwen\n407\t      - unconstrained\n408\t      - '32.08'\n409\t      - '7.85'\n410\t      - '38.3'\n411\t      - '2.7'\n412\t    - - Qwen\n413\t      - constrained\n414\t      - '26.72'\n415\t      - '8.18'\n416\t      - '0'\n417\t      - '0'\n418\t    - - Llama\n419\t      - unconstrained\n420\t      - '27.52'\n421\t      - '9.98'\n422\t      - '8.8'\n423\t      - '3.5'\n424\t    - - Llama\n425\t      - constrained\n426\t      - '26.91'\n427\t      - '8.91'\n428\t      - '0'\n429\t      - '0.8'\n430\t  figures_description:\n431\t  - 'Paired bar chart: Trigger-F1 degradation under constrained decoding in FT EE'\n432\t  analysis: 'EE FT composability 在 worst 档被完全 dismiss。核心攻击: (a) Trigger-F1 降 5pp 是\n433\t    unacceptable quality degradation; (b) Arg-F1 改善不显著且 Llama 实际下降; (c) \"This confirms\n434\t    constrained decoding for IE is a straightforward application of XGrammar with\n435\t    a lookup table.\"\n436\t\n437\t    '\n438\t- name: Grammar-only cross-model validation (Qwen/Llama EE)\n439\t  plan_id: P033\n440\t  description: Grammar-only ablation on Qwen 和 Llama WikiEvents EE for completeness\n441\t  expected_results:\n442\t    qwen_grammar_only_EV_pct: 0\n443\t    qwen_grammar_only_RoV_pct: 71.5\n444\t    qwen_grammar_only_AC_pct: 10.2\n445\t    qwen_grammar_only_CF_pct: 0.7\n446\t    qwen_grammar_only_entity_f1: 13.8\n447\t    llama_grammar_only_EV_pct: 0\n448\t    llama_grammar_only_RoV_pct: 76.4\n449\t    llama_grammar_only_AC_pct: 14.5\n450\t    llama_grammar_only_CF_pct: 0.5\n451\t    llama_grammar_only_entity_f1: 17.2\n452\t  result_rationale: '预测数据。基于 Mistral grammar-only 模式（RoV=64%, AC=13.8%），Qwen/Llama\n453\t    预计: EV→0%（grammar 消除）, RoV 保持 70-77%（grammar 无法约束 event-conditioned roles）, AC\n454\t    上升至 10-15%（latent violation surfacing）。Worst 档 reviewer: \"Redundant — the Mistral\n455\t    ablation already shows this, and the conclusion is trivially expected.\" 三模型 一致性虽是完整消融证据，但被视为不增加\n456\t    insight。\n457\t\n458\t    '\n459\t  tables:\n460\t  - name: EE Grammar-Only Ablation (3 Models)\n461\t    columns:\n462\t    - Model\n463\t    - EV%\n464\t    - RoV%\n465\t    - AC%\n466\t    - CF%\n467\t    - Ent-F1\n468\t    rows:\n469\t    - - Mistral (actual)\n470\t      - '0'\n471\t      - '64.0'\n472\t      - '13.8'\n473\t      - '1.1'\n474\t      - '11.9'\n475\t    - - Qwen (predicted)\n476\t      - '0'\n477\t      - '71.5'\n478\t      - '10.2'\n479\t      - '0.7'\n480\t      - '13.8'\n481\t    - - Llama (predicted)\n482\t      - '0'\n483\t      - '76.4'\n484\t      - '14.5'\n485\t      - '0.5'\n486\t      - '17.2'\n487\t  figures_description: []\n488\t  analysis: '三模型 grammar-only 一致模式（EV→0%, RoV≫0%, AC↑）在方法论上完整，但 reviewer 认为 不增加任何\n489\t    insight: \"it''s obvious that grammar constraints can only handle vocabulary-level\n490\t    violations, not semantic ones.\"\n491\t\n492\t    '\n493\t- name: Bootstrap CI for EE metrics\n494\t  plan_id: P034\n495\t  description: Statistical significance testing for EE F1 changes (10000× bootstrap)\n496\t  expected_results:\n497\t    qwen_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.55\n498\t    qwen_trigger_f1_p: 0.18\n499\t    qwen_entity_f1_delta_pp: 14.09\n500\t    qwen_entity_f1_p: 0.001\n501\t    qwen_arg_f1_delta_pp: 1.59\n502\t    qwen_arg_f1_p: 0.42\n503\t    llama_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.76\n504\t    llama_trigger_f1_p: 0.22\n505\t    llama_entity_f1_delta_pp: 17.63\n506\t    llama_entity_f1_p: 0.001\n507\t    llama_arg_f1_delta_pp: 1.18\n508\t    llama_arg_f1_p: 0.38\n509\t    mistral_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.46\n510\t    mistral_trigger_f1_p: 0.31\n511\t    mistral_entity_f1_delta_pp: 11.71\n512\t    mistral_entity_f1_p: 0.001\n513\t    mistral_arg_f1_delta_pp: 0.31\n514\t    mistral_arg_f1_p: 0.61\n515\t  result_rationale: '预测数据。Bootstrap CI 预计显示: (a) Entity-F1 改善（0%→11-17%）统计显著（p<0.01），但完全来自\n516\t    format compliance 恢复 （grammar 强制 valid JSON → parser 识别 entity）——不是语义提升。 (b) Trigger-F1\n517\t    改善（+1.5-1.8pp）全部不显著（p>0.15），绝对值太低（3-13%）variance 太大。 (c) Arg-F1 改善全部不显著——绝对值接近零。\n518\t    Worst 档 reviewer: \"The only statistically significant improvement is entity F1,\n519\t    which is entirely attributable to format compliance, not extraction improvement.\n520\t    No significant improvement on any semantically meaningful metric.\"\n521\t\n522\t    '\n523\t  tables:\n524\t  - name: EE Bootstrap CI Summary\n525\t    columns:\n526\t    - Model\n527\t    - Metric\n528\t    - Delta-pp\n529\t    - p-value\n530\t    - Sig?\n531\t    rows:\n532\t    - - Qwen\n533\t      - Trigger-F1\n534\t      - '+1.55'\n535\t      - '0.18'\n536\t      - 'No'\n537\t    - - Qwen\n538\t      - Entity-F1\n539\t      - '+14.09'\n540\t      - <0.001\n541\t      - Yes*\n542\t    - - Qwen\n543\t      - Arg-F1\n544\t      - '+1.59'\n545\t      - '0.42'\n546\t      - 'No'\n547\t    - - Llama\n548\t      - Trigger-F1\n549\t      - '+1.76'\n550\t      - '0.22'\n551\t      - 'No'\n552\t    - - Llama\n553\t      - Entity-F1\n554\t      - '+17.63'\n555\t      - <0.001\n556\t      - Yes*\n557\t    - - Llama\n558\t      - Arg-F1\n559\t      - '+1.18'\n560\t      - '0.38'\n561\t      - 'No'\n562\t    - - Mistral\n563\t      - Trigger-F1\n564\t      - '+1.46'\n565\t      - '0.31'\n566\t      - 'No'\n567\t    - - Mistral\n568\t      - Entity-F1\n569\t      - '+11.71'\n570\t      - <0.001\n571\t      - Yes*\n572\t    - - Mistral\n573\t      - Arg-F1\n574\t      - '+0.31'\n575\t      - '0.61'\n576\t      - 'No'\n577\t  figures_description:\n578\t  - Forest plot of EE F1 deltas with 95% CI, *=format compliance only\n579\t  analysis: 'Bootstrap CI 成为双刃剑: Entity-F1 显著但仅是 format compliance（*标注）， Trigger-F1\n580\t    和 Arg-F1 均不显著。Reviewer: \"No significant improvement on any semantically meaningful\n581\t    metric.\" 这与 RE 结果（DocRED R-F1 +0.50pp p<0.001）形成 对比，强化 \"EE 实验是 toy\" 的攻击。\n582\t\n583\t    '\n584\t- name: Latency overhead measurement\n585\t  plan_id: P035\n586\t  description: 'Wall-clock comparison: unconstrained vs constrained decoding overhead'\n587\t  expected_results:\n588\t    zs_scierc_overhead_pct: 13.1\n589\t    zs_scierc_mean_unc_s: 4.163\n590\t    zs_scierc_mean_con_s: 4.71\n591\t    ft_scierc_overhead_pct: 10.0\n592\t    ft_scierc_mean_unc_s: 2.612\n593\t    ft_scierc_mean_con_s: 2.873\n594\t    beam4_constraint_overhead_pct: 16.5\n595\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据（p8_latency_overhead: 13.1%, p8c_ft_scierc_latency: 10%）。Latency\n596\t    本身不是主要攻击面——13% 可接受。但 worst 档 reviewer 将其嵌入 cost-benefit: \"13% latency for a method\n597\t    that introduces 10-21% cross-field violations and achieves no significant F1 improvement\n598\t    in ZS — the trade-off is unfavorable.\" 在综合评估中作为 additional cost。\n599\t\n600\t    '\n601\t  tables:\n602\t  - name: Latency Overhead Summary\n603\t    columns:\n604\t    - Setting\n605\t    - Overhead%\n606\t    - unc s/doc\n607\t    - con s/doc\n608\t    rows:\n609\t    - - ZS SciERC\n610\t      - '13.1'\n611\t      - '4.16'\n612\t      - '4.71'\n613\t    - - FT SciERC\n614\t      - '10.0'\n615\t      - '2.61'\n616\t      - '2.87'\n617\t    - - FT Beam-4\n618\t      - '16.5'\n619\t      - '3.45'\n620\t      - '4.01'\n621\t  figures_description: []\n622\t  analysis: 'Latency 单独不构成 reject 理由，但 reviewer 在综合评估中使用: \"Your method adds 13% latency,\n623\t    introduces CF violations, and provides no significant F1 gain in ZS.\"\n624\t\n625\t    '\n626\t- name: 70B LoRA SciERC unconstrained eval\n627\t  plan_id: R16_70B_LORA_SCIERC_UNC\n628\t  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA fine-tuned, SciERC unconstrained evaluation\n629\t  expected_results:\n630\t    R_F1: 44.73\n631\t    E_F1: 64.86\n632\t    DR_pct: 1.5\n633\t    RV_pct: 0\n634\t    ET_pct: 0\n635\t    CF_pct: 0\n636\t    parse_fail_pct: 0\n637\t    total_samples: 551\n638\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据（eval_70b_lora_scierc_unconstrained DONE）。R-F1=44.73% 与\n639\t    8B LoRA Qwen (43.86%) 和 Llama (45.45%) 在同一水平——70B+AWQ-INT4 量化并未带来显著优势。 DR baseline=1.50%\n640\t    高于 Llama-8B LoRA (1.11%) 但低于 Qwen-8B LoRA (1.95%)。 关键: 这个 baseline 设定了 constrained\n641\t    eval 的对比基准。如果 constrained 版本 DR 不能显著降低，或 R-F1 明显下降，70B LoRA 实验就变成负面证据。\n642\t\n643\t    '\n644\t  tables: []\n645\t  figures_description: []\n646\t  analysis: 'Unconstrained baseline 本身不是问题，R-F1=44.73% 是合理的。关键是 constrained eval 会如何表现。\n647\t\n648\t    '\n649\t- name: 70B LoRA SciERC constrained eval\n650\t  plan_id: R16_70B_LORA_SCIERC_CON\n651\t  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA, SciERC constrained (full_s1) — worst tier\n652\t    核心预测\n653\t  expected_results:\n654\t    R_F1: 43.2\n655\t    E_F1: 64.5\n656\t    DR_pct: 1.5\n657\t    RV_pct: 0\n658\t    ET_pct: 0\n659\t    CF_pct: 2.2\n660\t    parse_fail_pct: 5.0\n661\t    total_samples: 551\n662\t    delta_R_F1_pp: -1.53\n663\t    delta_E_F1_pp: -0.36\n664\t  result_rationale: '预测数据（worst tier 核心假设: DR>1% 或 R-F1 下降 >2pp 或 PF>10%）。 DR=1.5%（范围\n665\t    [0.5, 3.0]）: constrained decoding 未能消除 DR，与 8B LoRA 的 DR=0-0.09% 形成鲜明对比。机制: AWQ-INT4\n666\t    量化导致 logit distribution 偏移，semantic mask 的 top-k fallback 更频繁触发，残余 DR 更高。quantized\n667\t    logits 的 precision 不够导致 mask 边界 附近的 token 概率计算不精确。 R-F1 下降 1.53pp（范围 [-3.0, -0.5]）:\n668\t    从 44.73→43.2%，虽未超过 -2pp threshold，但 方向与 8B LoRA 的 near-zero/positive delta 完全相反。\n669\t    PF=5%: 量化模型在 constrained decoding 下偶尔产生重复或 truncation，但 SciERC 文档短， PF 不至于超过 10%。\n670\t    综合: DR>1% 已触发 worst tier 条件。Reviewer: \"Your method fails to eliminate domain-range\n671\t    violations on a quantized 70B model — the deployment scenario where guarantees\n672\t    matter most.\"\n673\t\n674\t    '\n675\t  tables:\n676\t  - name: 'LoRA SciERC: 8B vs 70B Constrained Impact'\n677\t    columns:\n678\t    - Model\n679\t    - unc DR%\n680\t    - con DR%\n681\t    - DR-reduction%\n682\t    - R-F1 delta\n683\t    - PF%\n684\t    rows:\n685\t    - - Qwen-8B LoRA\n686\t      - '1.95'\n687\t      - '0'\n688\t      - '100'\n689\t      - '-0.09'\n690\t      - '0'\n691\t    - - Llama-8B LoRA\n692\t      - '1.11'\n693\t      - '0.09'\n694\t      - '92'\n695\t      - '+0.02'\n696\t      - '0'\n697\t    - - Qwen-70B LoRA (pred)\n698\t      - '1.50'\n699\t      - '1.50'\n700\t      - '0'\n701\t      - '-1.53'\n702\t      - '5.0'\n703\t  figures_description:\n704\t  - 'Model size vs DR reduction rate: 8B achieves 92-100%, 70B achieves 0%'\n705\t  analysis: '70B LoRA SciERC constrained 在 worst 档是关键打击: DR reduction=0%（constrained\n706\t    DR 等于 unconstrained DR），意味着 semantic mask 在量化模型上完全失效。R-F1 同时下降 1.5pp。 Reviewer:\n707\t    \"At 70B scale with INT4 quantization, your semantic constraints provide zero DR\n708\t    reduction while degrading extraction quality by 1.5pp. This undermines the entire\n709\t    scale generalization claim.\"\n710\t\n711\t    '\n712\t- name: 70B LoRA DocRED unconstrained eval\n713\t  plan_id: R16_70B_LORA_DOCRED_UNC\n714\t  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA, DocRED unconstrained — 实验 RUNNING\n715\t  expected_results:\n716\t    R_F1: 46.2\n717\t    E_F1: 85.0\n718\t    DR_pct: 0.65\n719\t    RV_pct: 0.05\n720\t    ET_pct: 0\n721\t    CF_pct: 0.04\n722\t    parse_fail_pct: 3.5\n723\t    total_samples: 200\n724\t  result_rationale: '预测数据（实验 RUNNING，200 docs 子集）。基于 8B LoRA DocRED 结果推断: Qwen-8B\n725\t    LoRA R-F1=40.86, Llama-8B LoRA R-F1=43.72, 70B 预计 +3-5pp 提升至 ~46%。 E-F1 预计 ~85%（8B\n726\t    范围 82-84%，70B 更强）。DR baseline 0.65%（8B 范围 0.49-0.76%）。 200 docs 子集使得结果统计 power\n727\t    较弱，增加 reviewer 质疑空间。\n728\t\n729\t    '\n730\t  tables: []\n731\t  figures_description: []\n732\t  analysis: '200 docs 子集（而非 998 全量）在 worst 档被 reviewer 质疑: \"Why only 200 documents\n733\t    for your most important scale experiment? This looks like a convenience sample,\n734\t    not a rigorous evaluation.\"\n735\t\n736\t    '\n737\t- name: 70B LoRA DocRED constrained eval\n738\t  plan_id: R16_70B_LORA_DOCRED_CON\n739\t  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA, DocRED constrained (full_s1) — worst tier\n740\t    核心预测\n741\t  expected_results:\n742\t    R_F1: 43.7\n743\t    E_F1: 84.5\n744\t    DR_pct: 2.8\n745\t    RV_pct: 0\n746\t    ET_pct: 0\n747\t    CF_pct: 1.8\n748\t    parse_fail_pct: 11.0\n749\t    total_samples: 200\n750\t    delta_R_F1_pp: -2.5\n751\t    delta_E_F1_pp: -0.5\n752\t  result_rationale: '预测数据（worst tier 核心假设: DR>1% 或 R-F1 下降 >2pp 或 PF>10%）。 DR=2.8%（范围\n753\t    [0.5, 5.0]）: DocRED 96-relation ontology 下量化模型的 semantic mask fallback 更频繁。8B\n754\t    LoRA DocRED constrained DR=0.01-0.21%，70B 的 2.8% 是数量级恶化。 机制: 量化后 logit space 的\n755\t    probability mass 在 96-relation ontology 下分布更不均匀， semantic mask 与 grammar mask\n756\t    的 intersection 更常为空→更多 fallback→更高残余 DR。 R-F1 下降 2.5pp（范围 [-4.0, -1.0]）: 从 46.2%→43.7%。这甚至低于\n757\t    8B Llama LoRA constrained (43.78%)——70B+量化+constrained 组合效果不如 8B full-precision。\n758\t    PF=11%（>10% threshold）: DocRED 长文档 + 量化 + constrained 三重因素叠加导致生成 退化（重复序列、early\n759\t    truncation、malformed JSON）。22 docs/200 无法评估。 综合: 全部三个 threshold 都被触发（DR>1% ✓,\n760\t    R-F1 drop >2pp ✓, PF>10% ✓）。\n761\t\n762\t    '\n763\t  tables:\n764\t  - name: 'LoRA DocRED: 8B vs 70B Constrained Full Comparison'\n765\t    columns:\n766\t    - Model\n767\t    - DR-con%\n768\t    - CF%\n769\t    - R-F1\n770\t    - R-F1-delta\n771\t    - PF%\n772\t    rows:\n773\t    - - Qwen-8B LoRA\n774\t      - '0.01'\n775\t      - '0.41'\n776\t      - '40.56'\n777\t      - '-0.30'\n778\t      - '8.5'\n779\t    - - Llama-8B LoRA\n780\t      - '0.21'\n781\t      - '0.21'\n782\t      - '43.78'\n783\t      - '+0.06'\n784\t      - '2.5'\n785\t    - - Qwen-70B LoRA (pred)\n786\t      - '2.80'\n787\t      - '1.80'\n788\t      - '43.70'\n789\t      - '-2.50'\n790\t      - '11.0'\n791\t  figures_description:\n792\t  - 'Scatter: model size vs constrained decoding effectiveness (DR reduction %)'\n793\t  - 'Bar: R-F1 delta under constrained decoding, 8B vs 70B'\n794\t  analysis: '70B LoRA DocRED 在 worst 档是 scale generalization claim 终结。三重失败: (a) DR\n795\t    2.8%——constrained 仍有显著残余 violations; (b) R-F1 下降 2.5pp 至 43.7%——低于 8B Llama LoRA\n796\t    constrained 43.78%; (c) 11% parse failures——22/200 docs 不可评估。 Reviewer: \"On DocRED,\n797\t    the 70B quantized model with constraints performs WORSE than the 8B full-precision\n798\t    model, while being far more expensive to run. The method does not scale to practical\n799\t    deployment scenarios with quantized large models.\" 这与 70B ZS 的 DR=0% 形成对比: \"Your\n800\t    method works at 70B only in zero-shot where F1 is 13% (toy); in the fine-tuned\n801\t    regime where F1 is meaningful (~46%), it fails.\"\n802\t\n803\t    '\n804\t- name: Post-hoc vs Constrained ZS Regime (6 configs)\n805\t  plan_id: W8_POSTHOC_ZS\n806\t  description: Post-hoc filtering R-F1 全面优于 constrained decoding in 5/6 ZS configs\n807\t    — worst tier 核心假设\n808\t  expected_results:\n809\t    qwen_scierc_posthoc_R_F1: 8.63\n810\t    qwen_scierc_constrained_R_F1: 8.36\n811\t    qwen_scierc_posthoc_wins: true\n812\t    llama_scierc_posthoc_R_F1: 2.71\n813\t    llama_scierc_constrained_R_F1: 2.54\n814\t    llama_scierc_posthoc_wins: true\n815\t    mistral_scierc_posthoc_R_F1: 3.94\n816\t    mistral_scierc_constrained_R_F1: 3.67\n817\t    mistral_scierc_posthoc_wins: true\n818\t    qwen_docred_posthoc_R_F1: 9.61\n819\t    qwen_docred_constrained_R_F1: 8.23\n820\t    qwen_docred_posthoc_wins: true\n821\t    llama_docred_posthoc_R_F1: 7.44\n822\t    llama_docred_constrained_R_F1: 6.27\n823\t    llama_docred_posthoc_wins: true\n824\t    mistral_docred_posthoc_R_F1: 3.85\n825\t    mistral_docred_constrained_R_F1: 5.52\n826\t    mistral_docred_posthoc_wins: false\n827\t    posthoc_win_count: 5\n828\t    posthoc_total_configs: 6\n829\t  result_rationale: '已有实际数据（w8_ft_posthoc_baseline）。Post-hoc R-F1 >= constrained R-F1\n830\t    in 5/6 ZS configs。仅 Mistral DocRED（极端 73.7% rejection rate 导致 TP 大量丢失）例外。 机制:\n831\t    low F1 regime 下（R-F1 < 13%），most predicted triples are FP。Post-hoc 通过删除 violating\n832\t    triples 移除大量 FP，precision 大幅提升。Constrained decoding 虽保留更多 triples （包括 TP），但 FP\n833\t    也更多。当 FP/TP ratio >> 1 时，post-hoc 的 precision gain 超过 recall loss。 Worst 档 reviewer:\n834\t    \"In the zero-shot regime that constitutes 60% of your evaluation, a simple post-hoc\n835\t    filter consistently outperforms your constrained decoding on the metric that matters\n836\t    (F1). What''s the point of engineering a complex constrained decoding pipeline\n837\t    when removing bad triples after generation works better?\"\n838\t\n839\t    '\n840\t  tables:\n841\t  - name: ZS Post-hoc vs Constrained R-F1\n842\t    columns:\n843\t    - Dataset\n844\t    - Model\n845\t    - Post-hoc R-F1\n846\t    - Constrained R-F1\n847\t    - Winner\n848\t    rows:\n849\t    - - SciERC\n850\t      - Qwen\n851\t      - '8.63'\n852\t      - '8.36'\n853\t      - Post-hoc\n854\t    - - SciERC\n855\t      - Llama\n856\t      - '2.71'\n857\t      - '2.54'\n858\t      - Post-hoc\n859\t    - - SciERC\n860\t      - Mistral\n861\t      - '3.94'\n862\t      - '3.67'\n863\t      - Post-hoc\n864\t    - - DocRED\n865\t      - Qwen\n866\t      - '9.61'\n867\t      - '8.23'\n868\t      - Post-hoc\n869\t    - - DocRED\n870\t      - Llama\n871\t      - '7.44'\n872\t      - '6.27'\n873\t      - Post-hoc\n874\t    - - DocRED\n875\t      - Mistral\n876\t      - '3.85'\n877\t      - '5.52'\n878\t      - Constrained\n879\t  figures_description:\n880\t  - 'Paired dot plot: post-hoc vs constrained R-F1 for 6 ZS configs with winner highlighted'\n881\t  analysis: '5/6 ZS configs post-hoc wins on R-F1。这是 worst 档最致命的 finding。Reviewer\n882\t    直接问: \"What''s the point?\" Paper 的 counter-arguments（recall preservation, operational\n883\t    properties, information coverage）在 ZS regime 的 sub-10% F1 下不具说服力。 Reframe 方向:\n884\t    将 constrained decoding 的价值锚定在 (a) FT regime（post-hoc wins 消失）， (b) EE task（post-hoc\n885\t    删除 99.6-100%），(c) structural guarantee（per-instance compliance vs statistical\n886\t    compliance），避开 ZS F1 比较。'\n887\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05e307b7-01f1-46d5-b4c9-ceb1e0f317e6","uuid":"8e05ed0b-35e1-45c8-8d58-c6ca7e678220","timestamp":"2026-05-22T06:41:19.983Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T052642/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心 \"type-valid IE\" framing 不成立，需完全 reframe。仍冲 EMNLP 2026（October\n  ARR cycle），不降级 venue。 Reframe: \"constrained decoding method paper\" → \"empirical\n  study paper with a tool\"。 新 title: \"How Do LLMs Violate Ontology Constraints? A\n  Systematic Study with Mitigation\"。 新 story: (1) violation landscape 系统性实证研究为主贡献；(2)\n  OntoCoDec 降级为 mitigation tool； (3) 重心转向 analysis findings — why prompt 不够、why post-hoc\n  不够、why grammar-only 不够、why CF 必然存在。 Novelty 锚点从 method → empirical findings + theoretical\n  analysis，回避 \"incremental over XGrammar\"。 补充: (a) per-relation-type violation pattern\n  深度分析；(b) GoLLIE code-generation IE violation 对比； (c) decidability taxonomy 扩展为 formal\n  framework。 预估 reviewer 评分: Overall 2.5–3.5, Novelty 2–3, Soundness 3–3.5, Significance\n  2–3, hostile_reviewer_count 2–3。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: WikiEvents Qwen3-8B unconstrained\n  plan_id: P021\n  description: WikiEvents EE unconstrained baseline, Qwen3-8B, 246 docs\n  expected_results:\n    parse_rate_pct: 88.6\n    EV_pct: 24.0\n    RoV_pct: 74.9\n    AC_pct: 0.3\n    CF_pct: 0\n    trigger_f1_pct: 11.84\n    argument_f1_pct: 0.09\n    entity_f1_pct: 0\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。Entity-F1=0%、Arg-F1≈0% 是 ZS EE 固有困难——模型无法输出 schema-valid\n    entity 格式。Worst 档 reviewer 抓住 baseline 几乎不工作这一点：\"Even the baseline shows EE is\n    barely functional; any ''improvement'' on near-zero is format compliance recovery,\n    not semantic extraction.\" RoV=74.9% 虽然展示了 constraint 需求，但 reviewer 反转叙事： \"This\n    proves ZS EE is fundamentally broken, not that your method fixes it.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: WikiEvents ZS Unconstrained Baselines (3 Models)\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Parse%\n    - EV%\n    - RoV%\n    - AC%\n    - Trig-F1\n    - Arg-F1\n    - Ent-F1\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - '88.6'\n      - '24.0'\n      - '74.9'\n      - '0.3'\n      - '11.8'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '91.9'\n      - '10.5'\n      - '88.8'\n      - '0.1'\n      - '5.7'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n    - - Mistral-7B\n      - '78.9'\n      - '37.3'\n      - '63.9'\n      - '0'\n      - '2.4'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-model violation type stacked bar chart (EV/RoV/AC)\n  analysis: '三模型 Entity-F1=0% / Arg-F1≈0% 成为 \"EE completely dismissed\" 的核心证据。 Reviewer:\n    \"Arg F1≈0, Entity F1 from 0→14% is just format compliance, not extraction improvement.\"\n    不视为 constraint enforcement 机会，而视为 task 选择失败。\n\n    '\n- name: WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B unconstrained\n  plan_id: P023\n  description: WikiEvents EE unconstrained baseline, Llama-3.1-8B, 246 docs\n  expected_results:\n    parse_rate_pct: 91.9\n    EV_pct: 10.5\n    RoV_pct: 88.8\n    AC_pct: 0.1\n    CF_pct: 0\n    trigger_f1_pct: 5.72\n    argument_f1_pct: 0\n    entity_f1_pct: 0\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。Llama RoV=88.8% 是三模型最高——近 9/10 argument role 不在 event\n    type 定义中。Trigger-F1=5.7% 低于 Qwen。Worst 档 reviewer: \"This model is completely non-functional\n    for EE. Constrained decoding on non-functional extraction is a constraint compliance\n    demo, not an IE contribution.\"\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Llama RoV=88.8% 超过 Qwen 74.9%，模型间 violation pattern 差异巨大，但 worst-tier\n    reviewer 不关心差异，只关心 Arg-F1=0%。\n\n    '\n- name: WikiEvents Mistral-7B unconstrained\n  plan_id: P025\n  description: WikiEvents EE unconstrained baseline, Mistral-7B-v0.3, 246 docs\n  expected_results:\n    parse_rate_pct: 78.9\n    EV_pct: 37.3\n    RoV_pct: 63.9\n    AC_pct: 0\n    CF_pct: 0\n    trigger_f1_pct: 2.41\n    argument_f1_pct: 0\n    entity_f1_pct: 0\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。Parse rate 最低 (78.9%)，EV 最高 (37.3%)——超 1/3 event type\n    是 OOV。 Trigger-F1=2.4% 几乎为零。Worst 档 reviewer: \"If your chosen model can''t even\n    produce valid event type names 37% of the time, the task setup itself is problematic.\"\n    选择明显 不适合此 task 的模型被质疑为 cherry-pick 不利 baseline 以夸大改善。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Mistral 是 EE 最差模型。Worst-tier reviewer 质疑为何选择它——如果用来展示\"更差模型更需要 constraint\"，那\n    Arg-F1=0% 的 baseline 使任何 improvement 都无意义。\n\n    '\n- name: WikiEvents Mistral grammar-only v3\n  plan_id: P027\n  description: Grammar-only ablation on Mistral WikiEvents, proves semantic layer\n    necessity for EE\n  expected_results:\n    parse_rate_pct: 88.6\n    EV_pct: 0\n    RoV_pct: 64.0\n    AC_pct: 13.8\n    CF_pct: 1.1\n    entity_f1_pct: 11.92\n    trigger_f1_pct: 3.37\n    argument_f1_pct: 0.27\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。Grammar-only 消除 EV→0% 但 RoV 仍 64%——grammar CFG 无法约束 80\n    个 event-type-conditioned argument roles。AC 上升至 13.8%（latent violation surfacing，\n    与 DocRED RE 模式一致）。本应是 two-layer necessity 有力证据。但 worst 档 reviewer: \"Of course\n    grammar can''t do semantic constraints — this is not an insight, it''s an expected\n    outcome. Your ablation confirms the obvious.\" 被视为 trivially expected， 不构成 contribution。更关键:\n    CF 从 1.1%(grammar-only) 升到 14.9%(full_s1)—— semantic 层引入大量 CF。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: WikiEvents Grammar-Only vs Full S1 (Mistral)\n    columns:\n    - Config\n    - EV%\n    - RoV%\n    - AC%\n    - CF%\n    - Ent-F1\n    rows:\n    - - unconstrained\n      - '37.3'\n      - '63.9'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n    - - grammar_only\n      - '0'\n      - '64.0'\n      - '13.8'\n      - '1.1'\n      - '11.9'\n    - - full_s1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '1.3'\n      - '14.9'\n      - '11.7'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-bar violation distribution comparison: unconstrained / grammar_only / full_s1'\n  analysis: 'Ablation 结论正确但被视为 trivial。更致命的是数据暴露了 CF trade-off: grammar_only CF=1.1%\n    → full_s1 CF=14.9%。Reviewer: \"Adding your semantic layer increases cross-field\n    violations by 14× while providing no extraction quality improvement. The cure\n    is worse than the disease.\"\n\n    '\n- name: WikiEvents EE post-hoc filtering (3 models)\n  plan_id: P028\n  description: Post-hoc filtering baseline for EE, quantifies argument deletion rate\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_args_before: 5467\n    qwen_args_after: 23\n    qwen_discard_pct: 99.6\n    llama_args_before: 5053\n    llama_args_after: 3\n    llama_discard_pct: 99.9\n    mistral_args_before: 6034\n    mistral_args_after: 0\n    mistral_discard_pct: 100.0\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据（从 v3 constrained 结果的 posthoc 字段计算）。Post-hoc 需删除 99.6-100%\n    arguments 才能达 0% violation——RE 中仅 16-48%。本应是 paper 强力卖点（\"post-hoc non-viable for\n    EE, constrained decoding is the only option\"）。但 worst 档 reviewer 翻转叙事: \"This confirms\n    ZS EE is fundamentally broken, not that your method solves it. When 99.6% of generated\n    arguments are violations, the model has no understanding of the task — your grammar\n    is just producing well-formatted noise.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Post-hoc Filtering: RE vs EE Discard Rate'\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - Model\n    - Discard%\n    - Remaining\n    rows:\n    - - RE SciERC\n      - Qwen\n      - 16.8%\n      - 1435 triples\n    - - RE DocRED\n      - Qwen\n      - 48.1%\n      - 9076 triples\n    - - EE WikiEvents\n      - Qwen\n      - 99.6%\n      - 23 args\n    - - EE WikiEvents\n      - Llama\n      - 99.9%\n      - 3 args\n    - - EE WikiEvents\n      - Mistral\n      - 100%\n      - 0 args\n  figures_description:\n  - Bar chart comparing post-hoc discard rates across RE and EE tasks\n  analysis: 'Post-hoc 毁灭性结果在 worst 档被用来否定整个 EE evaluation 的价值。Reviewer 不接受 \"constrained\n    decoding is the only option\" 论点，而认为 \"no option works for ZS EE, so why evaluate\n    it.\"\n\n    '\n- name: 70B SciERC unconstrained + constrained (ZS)\n  plan_id: P029\n  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 on SciERC ZS, scale generalization 8B→70B\n  expected_results:\n    unconstrained_DR_pct: 6.5\n    unconstrained_RV_pct: 0.6\n    unconstrained_R_F1: 11.22\n    unconstrained_E_F1: 35.17\n    constrained_DR_pct: 0\n    constrained_CF_pct: 3.66\n    constrained_R_F1: 11.24\n    constrained_E_F1: 35.14\n    parse_failures: 0\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。DR=0% 是完美消除，CF=3.66% 低于 8B 的 9.9%。但 worst 档关注两点: (1) R-F1=11.24%\n    仍是 \"toy evaluation\" — \"A 70B model achieving 11% relation F1 in ZS is not a serious\n    evaluation setting.\" (2) 70B unconstrained DR=6.5% 远低于 8B 的 15.4% — \"Larger models\n    are already more constraint-compliant; the marginal value of your method diminishes\n    with scale.\" 即 DR=0% 被视为 expected（大模型本来就更合规），不是 method contribution。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Scale Comparison: 8B vs 70B ZS SciERC'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - DR-unc%\n    - DR-con%\n    - CF-con%\n    - R-F1\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - '15.37'\n      - '0.93'\n      - '9.90'\n      - '8.36'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '13.34'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '6.56'\n      - '2.54'\n    - - Qwen3-70B\n      - '6.50'\n      - '0.00'\n      - '3.66'\n      - '11.24'\n  figures_description:\n  - Model scale vs baseline violation rate, showing diminishing marginal constraint\n    value\n  analysis: '70B 创造两难: (a) DR=0% 证明方法完美工作; (b) 大模型 baseline violation 更低，削弱 \"需要 constrained\n    decoding\" 论点。Reviewer: \"As models scale, they naturally become more compliant.\n    Your method solves a problem that is disappearing.\"\n\n    '\n- name: 70B DocRED unconstrained + constrained (ZS)\n  plan_id: P030\n  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 on DocRED ZS, scale generalization\n  expected_results:\n    unconstrained_DR_pct: 15.0\n    unconstrained_RV_pct: 7.8\n    unconstrained_ET_pct: 0.02\n    unconstrained_R_F1: 13.03\n    unconstrained_E_F1: 69.03\n    constrained_DR_pct: 0\n    constrained_CF_pct: 7.01\n    constrained_R_F1: 13.07\n    constrained_E_F1: 69.05\n    parse_failures: 1\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据。DR=0% 是 DocRED 上的最佳结果（优于 Qwen-8B 10.21%、Llama-8B 2.55%）。\n    但 CF=7.01%。Worst 档: \"On DocRED (96 relations), CF=7.01% means roughly 1 in 14\n    entities has inconsistent typing. Combined with 8B CF=10-12%, this is systematic,\n    not a corner case.\" 70B unc DR=15% 与 8B Qwen DR=18.46% 差距不大—— \"70B doesn''t help\n    much on DocRED, yet your method introduces 7% CF.\" CF 没有随模型规模减少（70B CF=7.01% >\n    Qwen-8B CF=2.57%），支持 \"CF is inherent to the method\" 攻击线。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: DocRED Cross-Scale CF Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - DR-unc%\n    - DR-con%\n    - CF-con%\n    - R-F1-delta\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - '18.46'\n      - '10.21'\n      - '2.57'\n      - '+0.50'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '26.07'\n      - '2.55'\n      - '12.02'\n      - '+0.29'\n    - - Qwen3-70B\n      - '15.00'\n      - '0.00'\n      - '7.01'\n      - '+0.04'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'DocRED 70B CF=7.01% 介于 Qwen-8B (2.57%) 和 Llama-8B (12.02%) 之间，没有 scale\n    改善趋势。Reviewer 判定 CF 是方法固有缺陷，非模型 artifact。\n\n    '\n- name: Error analysis / case study\n  plan_id: P031\n  description: '10-20 representative cases: AC residual 根因、CF root cause、qualitative\n    evidence'\n  expected_results:\n    ac_residual_cases_examined: 15\n    cf_root_cause_type_ambiguity_pct: 45\n    cf_root_cause_model_confusion_pct: 40\n    cf_root_cause_ontology_gap_pct: 15\n    actionable_insight_count: 2\n  result_rationale: '预测数据（定性分析）。AC 残余案例显示模型在语义相近 entity types（SID vs SEN, PER vs SID）\n    上持续混淆——constrained decoding 无法解决语义理解问题。CF 根因: ~45% 来自 ontology type system 语义边界模糊（Generic↔OtherScientificTerm），40%\n    来自模型在不同 relation context 下对同一 entity 的 type assignment 不一致，15% 来自 ontology 设计缺陷。\n    Worst 档 reviewer 引用 case study: \"Nearly half of CF is a dataset artifact and 40%\n    is a model capability problem — neither is addressable by constrained decoding.\n    The error analysis reveals that the method''s limitations are more interesting\n    than its contributions.\"\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Entity type confusion matrix for CF violations\n  - Case study examples with annotated violation chains\n  analysis: 'Error analysis 在 worst 档反而成为攻击弹药。每个 case 指向 constrained decoding 根本 局限:\n    只能 enforce 局部约束，无法解决跨 relation 一致性和模型语义理解。Reviewer 直接 引用 case study 论证 limitations\n    > contributions。\n\n    '\n- name: EE FT composability\n  plan_id: P032\n  description: Fine-tuned model + OntoCoDec composability on WikiEvents EE\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_ft_unc_trigger_f1: 32.08\n    qwen_ft_unc_arg_f1: 7.85\n    qwen_ft_unc_rov_pct: 38.3\n    qwen_ft_con_trigger_f1: 26.72\n    qwen_ft_con_arg_f1: 8.18\n    qwen_ft_con_rov_pct: 0\n    qwen_ft_con_ac_pct: 0\n    llama_ft_unc_trigger_f1: 27.52\n    llama_ft_unc_arg_f1: 9.98\n    llama_ft_unc_rov_pct: 8.8\n    llama_ft_con_trigger_f1: 26.91\n    llama_ft_con_arg_f1: 8.91\n    llama_ft_con_rov_pct: 0\n    llama_ft_con_ac_pct: 0.8\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据（p1_ee_ft_composability_r5 + p1_ee_ft_llama_r2）。关键问题: (1)\n    Qwen Trigger-F1 从 32.08%→26.72%（-5.36pp），constrained decoding 明显损害 trigger extraction\n    质量。Reviewer: \"Your method trades extraction quality for constraint compliance\n    — Structure Snowballing (Tam et al. 2024) already documented this trade-off.\"\n    (2) Arg-F1 改善微乎其微（Qwen +0.33pp, Llama -1.07pp 实际下降）。 (3) Llama constrained AC=0.8%\n    表明 FT regime 下仍无法完全消除 argument constraint violations。 Reviewer 总结: \"The only outcome\n    is constraint compliance at the cost of extraction performance. This is a net\n    negative contribution.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: EE FT Composability Impact\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Config\n    - Trig-F1\n    - Arg-F1\n    - RoV%\n    - AC%\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - unconstrained\n      - '32.08'\n      - '7.85'\n      - '38.3'\n      - '2.7'\n    - - Qwen\n      - constrained\n      - '26.72'\n      - '8.18'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n    - - Llama\n      - unconstrained\n      - '27.52'\n      - '9.98'\n      - '8.8'\n      - '3.5'\n    - - Llama\n      - constrained\n      - '26.91'\n      - '8.91'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.8'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: Trigger-F1 degradation under constrained decoding in FT EE'\n  analysis: 'EE FT composability 在 worst 档被完全 dismiss。核心攻击: (a) Trigger-F1 降 5pp 是\n    unacceptable quality degradation; (b) Arg-F1 改善不显著且 Llama 实际下降; (c) \"This confirms\n    constrained decoding for IE is a straightforward application of XGrammar with\n    a lookup table.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Grammar-only cross-model validation (Qwen/Llama EE)\n  plan_id: P033\n  description: Grammar-only ablation on Qwen 和 Llama WikiEvents EE for completeness\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_grammar_only_EV_pct: 0\n    qwen_grammar_only_RoV_pct: 71.5\n    qwen_grammar_only_AC_pct: 10.2\n    qwen_grammar_only_CF_pct: 0.7\n    qwen_grammar_only_entity_f1: 13.8\n    llama_grammar_only_EV_pct: 0\n    llama_grammar_only_RoV_pct: 76.4\n    llama_grammar_only_AC_pct: 14.5\n    llama_grammar_only_CF_pct: 0.5\n    llama_grammar_only_entity_f1: 17.2\n  result_rationale: '预测数据。基于 Mistral grammar-only 模式（RoV=64%, AC=13.8%），Qwen/Llama\n    预计: EV→0%（grammar 消除）, RoV 保持 70-77%（grammar 无法约束 event-conditioned roles）, AC\n    上升至 10-15%（latent violation surfacing）。Worst 档 reviewer: \"Redundant — the Mistral\n    ablation already shows this, and the conclusion is trivially expected.\" 三模型 一致性虽是完整消融证据，但被视为不增加\n    insight。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: EE Grammar-Only Ablation (3 Models)\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - EV%\n    - RoV%\n    - AC%\n    - CF%\n    - Ent-F1\n    rows:\n    - - Mistral (actual)\n      - '0'\n      - '64.0'\n      - '13.8'\n      - '1.1'\n      - '11.9'\n    - - Qwen (predicted)\n      - '0'\n      - '71.5'\n      - '10.2'\n      - '0.7'\n      - '13.8'\n    - - Llama (predicted)\n      - '0'\n      - '76.4'\n      - '14.5'\n      - '0.5'\n      - '17.2'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '三模型 grammar-only 一致模式（EV→0%, RoV≫0%, AC↑）在方法论上完整，但 reviewer 认为 不增加任何\n    insight: \"it''s obvious that grammar constraints can only handle vocabulary-level\n    violations, not semantic ones.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Bootstrap CI for EE metrics\n  plan_id: P034\n  description: Statistical significance testing for EE F1 changes (10000× bootstrap)\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.55\n    qwen_trigger_f1_p: 0.18\n    qwen_entity_f1_delta_pp: 14.09\n    qwen_entity_f1_p: 0.001\n    qwen_arg_f1_delta_pp: 1.59\n    qwen_arg_f1_p: 0.42\n    llama_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.76\n    llama_trigger_f1_p: 0.22\n    llama_entity_f1_delta_pp: 17.63\n    llama_entity_f1_p: 0.001\n    llama_arg_f1_delta_pp: 1.18\n    llama_arg_f1_p: 0.38\n    mistral_trigger_f1_delta_pp: 1.46\n    mistral_trigger_f1_p: 0.31\n    mistral_entity_f1_delta_pp: 11.71\n    mistral_entity_f1_p: 0.001\n    mistral_arg_f1_delta_pp: 0.31\n    mistral_arg_f1_p: 0.61\n  result_rationale: '预测数据。Bootstrap CI 预计显示: (a) Entity-F1 改善（0%→11-17%）统计显著（p<0.01），但完全来自\n    format compliance 恢复 （grammar 强制 valid JSON → parser 识别 entity）——不是语义提升。 (b) Trigger-F1\n    改善（+1.5-1.8pp）全部不显著（p>0.15），绝对值太低（3-13%）variance 太大。 (c) Arg-F1 改善全部不显著——绝对值接近零。\n    Worst 档 reviewer: \"The only statistically significant improvement is entity F1,\n    which is entirely attributable to format compliance, not extraction improvement.\n    No significant improvement on any semantically meaningful metric.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: EE Bootstrap CI Summary\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Metric\n    - Delta-pp\n    - p-value\n    - Sig?\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - Trigger-F1\n      - '+1.55'\n      - '0.18'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Qwen\n      - Entity-F1\n      - '+14.09'\n      - <0.001\n      - Yes*\n    - - Qwen\n      - Arg-F1\n      - '+1.59'\n      - '0.42'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Llama\n      - Trigger-F1\n      - '+1.76'\n      - '0.22'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Llama\n      - Entity-F1\n      - '+17.63'\n      - <0.001\n      - Yes*\n    - - Llama\n      - Arg-F1\n      - '+1.18'\n      - '0.38'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Mistral\n      - Trigger-F1\n      - '+1.46'\n      - '0.31'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Mistral\n      - Entity-F1\n      - '+11.71'\n      - <0.001\n      - Yes*\n    - - Mistral\n      - Arg-F1\n      - '+0.31'\n      - '0.61'\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - Forest plot of EE F1 deltas with 95% CI, *=format compliance only\n  analysis: 'Bootstrap CI 成为双刃剑: Entity-F1 显著但仅是 format compliance（*标注）， Trigger-F1\n    和 Arg-F1 均不显著。Reviewer: \"No significant improvement on any semantically meaningful\n    metric.\" 这与 RE 结果（DocRED R-F1 +0.50pp p<0.001）形成 对比，强化 \"EE 实验是 toy\" 的攻击。\n\n    '\n- name: Latency overhead measurement\n  plan_id: P035\n  description: 'Wall-clock comparison: unconstrained vs constrained decoding overhead'\n  expected_results:\n    zs_scierc_overhead_pct: 13.1\n    zs_scierc_mean_unc_s: 4.163\n    zs_scierc_mean_con_s: 4.71\n    ft_scierc_overhead_pct: 10.0\n    ft_scierc_mean_unc_s: 2.612\n    ft_scierc_mean_con_s: 2.873\n    beam4_constraint_overhead_pct: 16.5\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据（p8_latency_overhead: 13.1%, p8c_ft_scierc_latency: 10%）。Latency\n    本身不是主要攻击面——13% 可接受。但 worst 档 reviewer 将其嵌入 cost-benefit: \"13% latency for a method\n    that introduces 10-21% cross-field violations and achieves no significant F1 improvement\n    in ZS — the trade-off is unfavorable.\" 在综合评估中作为 additional cost。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Latency Overhead Summary\n    columns:\n    - Setting\n    - Overhead%\n    - unc s/doc\n    - con s/doc\n    rows:\n    - - ZS SciERC\n      - '13.1'\n      - '4.16'\n      - '4.71'\n    - - FT SciERC\n      - '10.0'\n      - '2.61'\n      - '2.87'\n    - - FT Beam-4\n      - '16.5'\n      - '3.45'\n      - '4.01'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Latency 单独不构成 reject 理由，但 reviewer 在综合评估中使用: \"Your method adds 13% latency,\n    introduces CF violations, and provides no significant F1 gain in ZS.\"\n\n    '\n- name: 70B LoRA SciERC unconstrained eval\n  plan_id: R16_70B_LORA_SCIERC_UNC\n  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA fine-tuned, SciERC unconstrained evaluation\n  expected_results:\n    R_F1: 44.73\n    E_F1: 64.86\n    DR_pct: 1.5\n    RV_pct: 0\n    ET_pct: 0\n    CF_pct: 0\n    parse_fail_pct: 0\n    total_samples: 551\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据（eval_70b_lora_scierc_unconstrained DONE）。R-F1=44.73% 与\n    8B LoRA Qwen (43.86%) 和 Llama (45.45%) 在同一水平——70B+AWQ-INT4 量化并未带来显著优势。 DR baseline=1.50%\n    高于 Llama-8B LoRA (1.11%) 但低于 Qwen-8B LoRA (1.95%)。 关键: 这个 baseline 设定了 constrained\n    eval 的对比基准。如果 constrained 版本 DR 不能显著降低，或 R-F1 明显下降，70B LoRA 实验就变成负面证据。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Unconstrained baseline 本身不是问题，R-F1=44.73% 是合理的。关键是 constrained eval 会如何表现。\n\n    '\n- name: 70B LoRA SciERC constrained eval\n  plan_id: R16_70B_LORA_SCIERC_CON\n  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA, SciERC constrained (full_s1) — worst tier\n    核心预测\n  expected_results:\n    R_F1: 43.2\n    E_F1: 64.5\n    DR_pct: 1.5\n    RV_pct: 0\n    ET_pct: 0\n    CF_pct: 2.2\n    parse_fail_pct: 5.0\n    total_samples: 551\n    delta_R_F1_pp: -1.53\n    delta_E_F1_pp: -0.36\n  result_rationale: '预测数据（worst tier 核心假设: DR>1% 或 R-F1 下降 >2pp 或 PF>10%）。 DR=1.5%（范围\n    [0.5, 3.0]）: constrained decoding 未能消除 DR，与 8B LoRA 的 DR=0-0.09% 形成鲜明对比。机制: AWQ-INT4\n    量化导致 logit distribution 偏移，semantic mask 的 top-k fallback 更频繁触发，残余 DR 更高。quantized\n    logits 的 precision 不够导致 mask 边界 附近的 token 概率计算不精确。 R-F1 下降 1.53pp（范围 [-3.0, -0.5]）:\n    从 44.73→43.2%，虽未超过 -2pp threshold，但 方向与 8B LoRA 的 near-zero/positive delta 完全相反。\n    PF=5%: 量化模型在 constrained decoding 下偶尔产生重复或 truncation，但 SciERC 文档短， PF 不至于超过 10%。\n    综合: DR>1% 已触发 worst tier 条件。Reviewer: \"Your method fails to eliminate domain-range\n    violations on a quantized 70B model — the deployment scenario where guarantees\n    matter most.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'LoRA SciERC: 8B vs 70B Constrained Impact'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - unc DR%\n    - con DR%\n    - DR-reduction%\n    - R-F1 delta\n    - PF%\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-8B LoRA\n      - '1.95'\n      - '0'\n      - '100'\n      - '-0.09'\n      - '0'\n    - - Llama-8B LoRA\n      - '1.11'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '92'\n      - '+0.02'\n      - '0'\n    - - Qwen-70B LoRA (pred)\n      - '1.50'\n      - '1.50'\n      - '0'\n      - '-1.53'\n      - '5.0'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Model size vs DR reduction rate: 8B achieves 92-100%, 70B achieves 0%'\n  analysis: '70B LoRA SciERC constrained 在 worst 档是关键打击: DR reduction=0%（constrained\n    DR 等于 unconstrained DR），意味着 semantic mask 在量化模型上完全失效。R-F1 同时下降 1.5pp。 Reviewer:\n    \"At 70B scale with INT4 quantization, your semantic constraints provide zero DR\n    reduction while degrading extraction quality by 1.5pp. This undermines the entire\n    scale generalization claim.\"\n\n    '\n- name: 70B LoRA DocRED unconstrained eval\n  plan_id: R16_70B_LORA_DOCRED_UNC\n  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA, DocRED unconstrained — 实验 RUNNING\n  expected_results:\n    R_F1: 46.2\n    E_F1: 85.0\n    DR_pct: 0.65\n    RV_pct: 0.05\n    ET_pct: 0\n    CF_pct: 0.04\n    parse_fail_pct: 3.5\n    total_samples: 200\n  result_rationale: '预测数据（实验 RUNNING，200 docs 子集）。基于 8B LoRA DocRED 结果推断: Qwen-8B\n    LoRA R-F1=40.86, Llama-8B LoRA R-F1=43.72, 70B 预计 +3-5pp 提升至 ~46%。 E-F1 预计 ~85%（8B\n    范围 82-84%，70B 更强）。DR baseline 0.65%（8B 范围 0.49-0.76%）。 200 docs 子集使得结果统计 power\n    较弱，增加 reviewer 质疑空间。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '200 docs 子集（而非 998 全量）在 worst 档被 reviewer 质疑: \"Why only 200 documents\n    for your most important scale experiment? This looks like a convenience sample,\n    not a rigorous evaluation.\"\n\n    '\n- name: 70B LoRA DocRED constrained eval\n  plan_id: R16_70B_LORA_DOCRED_CON\n  description: Qwen3-70B AWQ-INT4 LoRA, DocRED constrained (full_s1) — worst tier\n    核心预测\n  expected_results:\n    R_F1: 43.7\n    E_F1: 84.5\n    DR_pct: 2.8\n    RV_pct: 0\n    ET_pct: 0\n    CF_pct: 1.8\n    parse_fail_pct: 11.0\n    total_samples: 200\n    delta_R_F1_pp: -2.5\n    delta_E_F1_pp: -0.5\n  result_rationale: '预测数据（worst tier 核心假设: DR>1% 或 R-F1 下降 >2pp 或 PF>10%）。 DR=2.8%（范围\n    [0.5, 5.0]）: DocRED 96-relation ontology 下量化模型的 semantic mask fallback 更频繁。8B\n    LoRA DocRED constrained DR=0.01-0.21%，70B 的 2.8% 是数量级恶化。 机制: 量化后 logit space 的\n    probability mass 在 96-relation ontology 下分布更不均匀， semantic mask 与 grammar mask\n    的 intersection 更常为空→更多 fallback→更高残余 DR。 R-F1 下降 2.5pp（范围 [-4.0, -1.0]）: 从 46.2%→43.7%。这甚至低于\n    8B Llama LoRA constrained (43.78%)——70B+量化+constrained 组合效果不如 8B full-precision。\n    PF=11%（>10% threshold）: DocRED 长文档 + 量化 + constrained 三重因素叠加导致生成 退化（重复序列、early\n    truncation、malformed JSON）。22 docs/200 无法评估。 综合: 全部三个 threshold 都被触发（DR>1% ✓,\n    R-F1 drop >2pp ✓, PF>10% ✓）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'LoRA DocRED: 8B vs 70B Constrained Full Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - DR-con%\n    - CF%\n    - R-F1\n    - R-F1-delta\n    - PF%\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-8B LoRA\n      - '0.01'\n      - '0.41'\n      - '40.56'\n      - '-0.30'\n      - '8.5'\n    - - Llama-8B LoRA\n      - '0.21'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '43.78'\n      - '+0.06'\n      - '2.5'\n    - - Qwen-70B LoRA (pred)\n      - '2.80'\n      - '1.80'\n      - '43.70'\n      - '-2.50'\n      - '11.0'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: model size vs constrained decoding effectiveness (DR reduction %)'\n  - 'Bar: R-F1 delta under constrained decoding, 8B vs 70B'\n  analysis: '70B LoRA DocRED 在 worst 档是 scale generalization claim 终结。三重失败: (a) DR\n    2.8%——constrained 仍有显著残余 violations; (b) R-F1 下降 2.5pp 至 43.7%——低于 8B Llama LoRA\n    constrained 43.78%; (c) 11% parse failures——22/200 docs 不可评估。 Reviewer: \"On DocRED,\n    the 70B quantized model with constraints performs WORSE than the 8B full-precision\n    model, while being far more expensive to run. The method does not scale to practical\n    deployment scenarios with quantized large models.\" 这与 70B ZS 的 DR=0% 形成对比: \"Your\n    method works at 70B only in zero-shot where F1 is 13% (toy); in the fine-tuned\n    regime where F1 is meaningful (~46%), it fails.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Post-hoc vs Constrained ZS Regime (6 configs)\n  plan_id: W8_POSTHOC_ZS\n  description: Post-hoc filtering R-F1 全面优于 constrained decoding in 5/6 ZS configs\n    — worst tier 核心假设\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_scierc_posthoc_R_F1: 8.63\n    qwen_scierc_constrained_R_F1: 8.36\n    qwen_scierc_posthoc_wins: true\n    llama_scierc_posthoc_R_F1: 2.71\n    llama_scierc_constrained_R_F1: 2.54\n    llama_scierc_posthoc_wins: true\n    mistral_scierc_posthoc_R_F1: 3.94\n    mistral_scierc_constrained_R_F1: 3.67\n    mistral_scierc_posthoc_wins: true\n    qwen_docred_posthoc_R_F1: 9.61\n    qwen_docred_constrained_R_F1: 8.23\n    qwen_docred_posthoc_wins: true\n    llama_docred_posthoc_R_F1: 7.44\n    llama_docred_constrained_R_F1: 6.27\n    llama_docred_posthoc_wins: true\n    mistral_docred_posthoc_R_F1: 3.85\n    mistral_docred_constrained_R_F1: 5.52\n    mistral_docred_posthoc_wins: false\n    posthoc_win_count: 5\n    posthoc_total_configs: 6\n  result_rationale: '已有实际数据（w8_ft_posthoc_baseline）。Post-hoc R-F1 >= constrained R-F1\n    in 5/6 ZS configs。仅 Mistral DocRED（极端 73.7% rejection rate 导致 TP 大量丢失）例外。 机制:\n    low F1 regime 下（R-F1 < 13%），most predicted triples are FP。Post-hoc 通过删除 violating\n    triples 移除大量 FP，precision 大幅提升。Constrained decoding 虽保留更多 triples （包括 TP），但 FP\n    也更多。当 FP/TP ratio >> 1 时，post-hoc 的 precision gain 超过 recall loss。 Worst 档 reviewer:\n    \"In the zero-shot regime that constitutes 60% of your evaluation, a simple post-hoc\n    filter consistently outperforms your constrained decoding on the metric that matters\n    (F1). What''s the point of engineering a complex constrained decoding pipeline\n    when removing bad triples after generation works better?\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: ZS Post-hoc vs Constrained R-F1\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Model\n    - Post-hoc R-F1\n    - Constrained R-F1\n    - Winner\n    rows:\n    - - SciERC\n      - Qwen\n      - '8.63'\n      - '8.36'\n      - Post-hoc\n    - - SciERC\n      - Llama\n      - '2.71'\n      - '2.54'\n      - Post-hoc\n    - - SciERC\n      - Mistral\n      - '3.94'\n      - '3.67'\n      - Post-hoc\n    - - DocRED\n      - Qwen\n      - '9.61'\n      - '8.23'\n      - Post-hoc\n    - - DocRED\n      - Llama\n      - '7.44'\n      - '6.27'\n      - Post-hoc\n    - - DocRED\n      - Mistral\n      - '3.85'\n      - '5.52'\n      - Constrained\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired dot plot: post-hoc vs constrained R-F1 for 6 ZS configs with winner highlighted'\n  analysis: '5/6 ZS configs post-hoc wins on R-F1。这是 worst 档最致命的 finding。Reviewer\n    直接问: \"What''s the point?\" Paper 的 counter-arguments（recall preservation, operational\n    properties, information coverage）在 ZS regime 的 sub-10% F1 下不具说服力。 Reframe 方向:\n    将 constrained decoding 的价值锚定在 (a) FT regime（post-hoc wins 消失）， (b) EE task（post-hoc\n    删除 99.6-100%），(c) structural guarantee（per-instance compliance vs statistical\n    compliance），避开 ZS F1 比较。'\n","numLines":887,"startLine":1,"totalLines":887}}}
