{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AnqNQWhxn6E7xw1b9mcSDv","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 schema_semantic_constrained_ie 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (139 个)\\n\\n- **llama_scierc_full_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **llama_scierc_unconstrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_full_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_semantic_only**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_grammar_only**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_scierc_unconstrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_docred_full_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_docred_semantic_only**: DONE (success) — \\n- **phase2_docred_unconstrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_docred_schema_r2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **phase2_s2_pilot50**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_docred_schema**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_violation_rate_docred**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_scierc_schema**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_phase0_violation_rate**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-22\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| eval_70b_lora_docred_200_s1_constrained | 70B LoRA DocRED with Full S1 constrained decoding on 200-doc subset will achieve DR→0% while maintaining R-F1 comparable to unconstrained, confirming scale-independent constraint composability on DocRED at 70B scale | — | — | — |\\n| eval_70b_lora_scierc_s1_constrained | 70B LoRA SciERC with Full S1 constrained decoding will achieve DR→0% while maintaining R-F1 comparable to unconstrained (44.73), confirming scale-independent constraint effectiveness at 70B with fine-tuning | — | — | — |\\n| eval_70b_lora_docred_200_unconstrained | 70B LoRA-finetuned model (r16, Llama-3.1-70B-AWQ-INT4) will achieve higher R-F1 than 8B models on DocRED 200-doc subset unconstrained extraction, serving as the unconstrained baseline for S1 comparison at 70B scale | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- r16_70b_lora_scierc_eval: 70B AWQ INT4 LoRA fine-tuned on SciERC will achieve higher R-F1 than 8B FT (Qwen 47.15, Llama 46.13) and S1 constraints will maintain DR→0% at 70B scale（准备中）\\n- p1_llama_ee_ft（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **eval_70b_lora_scierc_unconstrained** (success): 70B LoRA-finetuned model (r16, Llama-3.1-70B-AWQ-INT4) will achieve higher R-F1 than 8B models (Qwen FT R-F1=47.15, Llama FT R-F1=46.13) on SciERC unconstrained extraction due to larger model capacity ← 基于 r16_70b_lora_scierc\\n- **r16_70b_docred_zs_s1** (success): Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct-AWQ-INT4 with Full S1 constrained decoding on DocRED ZS will achieve DR→0% with R-F1 stable vs unconstrained, extending 70B SciERC results to DocRED and confirming scale-independent constraint effectiveness across datasets\\n- **d066_sweep_llama_beam8_unc** (success): d066 DocRED beam sweep sub-task: Llama beam8 unconstrained on 200-doc subset (westd-16980 GPU1). Part of d066_beam_sweep parent experiment. ← 基于 d066_beam_sweep\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 111 / 负向 7 / 失败 11 / 共 133\\nCF_pct: 0 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\nDR_pct: 1.5 ↑（近 3 次 success）\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-16980: 无 GPU 信息\\nwestd-21461: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp_phase0_docred_schema_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- w1_cf_fallback_docred: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- w1_cf_fallback_llama_scierc: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- w1_cf_fallback_llama_docred: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- w9_qwen_docred_zs_sampling: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- p8b_docred_latency: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- p1_ee_ft_composability: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- p1_ee_ft_composability_r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- p1_ee_ft_composability_r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- p1_ee_ft_composability_r4: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- p1_ee_ft_llama: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- d064_docred_full_beam: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- d066_docred_beam_sweep: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- d065_qwen_greedy_4096: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- d066_sweep_llama_scierc_beam1_unc: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TY2PdUMBf17DSWtyunKK8U","session_id":"05e307b7-01f1-46d5-b4c9-ceb1e0f317e6","u