{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UqaGmXveiXRReQuTp1z8oa","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# schema_semantic_constrained_ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-21 03:37 UTC | 更新原因: D081 combined plan: D079 trie + D080 GoLLIE/triple/deployment + D081 user 5-point evaluation\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nOntoCoDec: 两层约束解码（grammar + semantic）将 IE schema 翻译为 token-level constraints，消除 LLM-based IE 的 type violations。**目标: EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25 提交**。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n**阶段**: D079+D080+D081 综合执行中 — **提交前最后一轮**\\\\n\\\\n**审稿轨迹**: R12 (3.5) → R13 (3.0) → R14 (3.5) → R15 (3.0) → R16 (3.0)\\\\n振荡模式：3.0-3.5 交替，结构性天花板约 3.5\\\\n\\\\n**并行工作流**:\\\\n- Trie baseline (P0): westd-21461 cuda:1 — SciERC 4 configs GCD-equivalent 对比\\\\n- GoLLIE head-to-head (P0): westd-16980 cuda:1 — 同模型 code-style prompt 对比\\\\n- Beam 998-doc (P0): 两台 cuda:0 — full DocRED CF 缓解证据\\\\n- Triple validity (P1): valid-triple precision + error propagation 分析\\\\n- Paper Agent: deployment-grade Abstract + DocRED data leakage 澄清\\\\n- R16 text modifications (MF2/MF3/W1-W6/M1-M7): 已完成\\\\n\\\\n**R15→R16 已确认的改善（保持）**:\\\\n- ✅ §5 显式 BoostCD/GCD 对比段落\\\\n- ✅ \\\\\\\"formal guarantees\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"enforcement mechanisms\\\\\\\"\\\\n- ✅ κ̄ 移出 contributions enumerate\\\\n- ✅ ≤ 8 页（Regression Checklist 10/10 PASS）\\\\n- ✅ Fallback causal tracing (100% DR from fallback)\\\\n- ✅ 跨语言限制 in Limitations\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] P0: 确认 trie baseline Worker 状态 + 结果提取\\\\n- [ ] P0: GoLLIE SciERC head-to-head 实验\\\\n- [ ] P0: Beam 998-doc 结果提取 (Llama + Qwen)\\\\n- [ ] P1: Triple validity — valid-triple precision + error propagation\\\\n- [ ] P1: Paper Agent deployment-grade + DocRED leakage 澄清\\\\n- [ ] P2: WikiEvents 官方 test split 大小核实\\\\n- [ ] P2: 70B LoRA SciERC